<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<input type="hidden" name="id" value="<c:out value='${record.id}'/>"><input type="hidden" name="version" value="${empty record.version ? 0 : record.version}"><label>${entity == 'users' ? '이름' : '제목 / 이름'}<input name="name" value="<c:out value='${record.name}'/>" maxlength="100" required></label>
<c:if test="${entity == 'users'}"><label>아이디<input name="username" value="<c:out value='${record.username}'/>" pattern="[a-zA-Z0-9._-]{3,40}" required></label><label>이메일<input type="email" name="email" value="<c:out value='${record.email}'/>" maxlength="150" required></label><label>비밀번호 (신규 필수 · 수정 시 공란이면 유지)<input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="new-password"></label><p class="muted">12자 이상, UTF-8 72바이트 이하</p><label>역할<select name="role"><c:forEach items="${['USER','MANAGER','ADMIN']}" var="v"><option value="${v}" ${record.role == v ? 'selected' : ''}>${labels[v]}</option></c:forEach></select></label><label>부서<select name="department_id"><option value="0">미지정</option><c:forEach items="${departmentsChoices}" var="v"><option value="${v.id}" ${record.department_id == v.id ? 'selected' : ''}><c:out value="${v.name}"/></option></c:forEach></select></label><label>계정 상태<select name="enabled"><option value="true" ${record.enabled != false ? 'selected' : ''}>활성</option><option value="false" ${record.enabled == false ? 'selected' : ''}>비활성</option></select></label></c:if>
<c:if test="${entity != 'users' && entity != 'departments'}"><label>내용<textarea name="description" rows="7" maxlength="4000" required><c:out value="${record.description}"/></textarea></label></c:if>
<c:if test="${entity == 'clients'}"><label>연락처<input name="contact" value="<c:out value='${record.contact}'/>" maxlength="150" required></label></c:if>
<c:if test="${entity == 'projects' || entity == 'tasks'}"><div class="form-grid"><label>담당자<select name="owner_id" required><c:forEach items="${usersChoices}" var="v"><c:if test="${manager || v.id == actorId}"><option value="${v.id}" ${record.owner_id == v.id || (empty record.id && v.id == actorId) ? 'selected' : ''}><c:out value="${v.name}"/></option></c:if></c:forEach></select></label><label>마감일<input type="date" name="due_date" value="<c:out value='${record.due_date}'/>" required></label><label>상태<select name="status"><c:choose><c:when test="${entity == 'projects'}"><c:set var="statuses" value="${['PLANNED','ACTIVE','DONE']}"/></c:when><c:otherwise><c:set var="statuses" value="${['TODO','DOING','DONE']}"/></c:otherwise></c:choose><c:forEach items="${statuses}" var="v"><option value="${v}" ${record.status == v ? 'selected' : ''}>${labels[v]}</option></c:forEach></select></label><label>${entity == 'projects' ? '거래처' : '프로젝트'}<select name="${entity == 'projects' ? 'client_id' : 'project_id'}"><c:if test="${entity == 'projects'}"><option value="0">미지정</option></c:if><c:forEach items="${entity == 'projects' ? clientsChoices : projectsChoices}" var="v"><option value="${v.id}" ${(entity == 'projects' && record.client_id == v.id) || (entity == 'tasks' && record.project_id == v.id) ? 'selected' : ''}><c:out value="${v.name}"/></option></c:forEach></select></label></div><p class="muted">신규 등록은 준비/할 일 상태입니다. 상태는 준비 → 진행 → 완료 순서로 변경됩니다.</p></c:if>
<c:if test="${entity == 'approvals'}"><label>승인자<select name="approver_id" required><c:forEach items="${usersChoices}" var="v"><c:if test="${v.id != actorId && v.role != 'USER'}"><option value="${v.id}" ${record.approver_id == v.id ? 'selected' : ''}><c:out value="${v.name}"/> (${labels[v.role]})</option></c:if></c:forEach></select></label><p class="muted">임시저장 후 상세 화면에서 상신하세요. 반려 요청을 수정하면 임시저장 상태로 돌아갑니다.</p></c:if>